- op: discuss  # d225
  at: '2026-06-06T05:40:20Z'  # d225
  by: agent  # d225
  actor: jgstern_agent  # d225
  clock: 2  # d225
  nonce: d225  # d225
  message: "Found during tranche-05 Phase 7. deleak-ledger main() unconditionally wrote extract_map(deleaked_notes) to the --map path (deleak-ledger:481). A modern campaign-position-free ledger has no embedded F-numbers, so extract_map returns {}, and the write destroyed the orchestrator-maintained pass_row_map.json — the human's sole summed-severity-over-time source. The Phase-7 playbook step compounded it by instructing --map point at the real pass_row_map.json. Recovered tranche-05's map from verdicts+mapping (verified reproduces the trend). FIX (this PR): (1) deleak-ledger guards — only writes when the reconstruction is non-empty or the target is absent, never an empty {} over a populated map (+3 regression tests in tests/test_deleak_ledger_map_guard.py); (2) playbook Phase 7 now passes a throwaway --map path; (3) playbook Phase 5 documents the late fold/split severity-recompute-by-inheritance rule. Mark done on merge."  # d225
