  message: "Fixed and merged to dev (commit b09469a0e5, 'fix(deleak-ledger): guard --map against clobbering a populated map'). deleak-ledger now refuses to overwrite a populated --map with an empty reconstruction; +3 regression tests (tests/test_deleak_ledger.py, selected by the per-PR smart-test gate). Playbook Phase 7 switched to a throwaway --map path and Phase 5 documents the late fold/split severity-recompute-by-inheritance rule."  # e9d3
